WEBVTT

01:15.000 --> 01:19.120
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.480 --> 01:24.848
[Episode 29]

01:43.673 --> 01:44.164
Dad.

01:44.164 --> 01:45.113
Your waist is not good.

01:45.113 --> 01:46.473
Don't squat there.

01:46.473 --> 01:47.723
I'll do it.

01:47.723 --> 01:48.394
Stop.

01:48.394 --> 01:49.673
Almost done.

01:49.673 --> 01:50.523
Stand up.

01:50.523 --> 01:50.953
Okay.

01:50.953 --> 01:52.233
I'll do it.

01:52.233 --> 01:53.513
Sit here.

01:53.883 --> 01:54.923
Here.

01:54.923 --> 01:55.833
Sit.

01:55.833 --> 01:57.113
It's okay.

02:02.473 --> 02:03.443
Here.

02:03.443 --> 02:04.243
Have some rest.

02:04.243 --> 02:05.523
Drink some tea.

02:14.473 --> 02:18.461
We've been living here for more than 20 years.

02:18.963 --> 02:23.791
Mi and you grew up in this house.

02:24.123 --> 02:27.331
We spent 40,000 yuan on this house.

02:27.473 --> 02:29.097
Just 40,000 yuan?

02:29.683 --> 02:32.723
It was not a small sum of money at that time.

02:32.723 --> 02:34.003
Really?

02:37.513 --> 02:38.793
Dad,

02:39.163 --> 02:40.843
will we sell this house?

02:40.843 --> 02:41.913
No.

02:41.913 --> 02:43.573
Your mom won't sell it.

02:43.883 --> 02:46.563
She wants to clean the room and rent it.

02:46.633 --> 02:48.683
There is a junior high school
in front of our community,

02:48.683 --> 02:50.163
and a senior high school behind.

02:50.163 --> 02:51.703
It's easy to rent it.

02:57.403 --> 02:59.075
You drew all those.

02:59.563 --> 03:01.419
What's that?

03:01.443 --> 03:03.067
It's on the painting.

03:03.473 --> 03:06.313
The beautiful and confident boss, Xu Hongdou.

03:06.313 --> 03:08.993
The beggar, Xu Hongmi.

03:12.033 --> 03:14.403
When did I draw that?

03:14.403 --> 03:17.083
I wanted to be a boss when I was little?

03:18.513 --> 03:24.037
You moved here at primary
school, about seven years old.

03:25.403 --> 03:27.169
When I recall the memory,

03:27.193 --> 03:31.373
you were so interesting when you were little.

03:31.403 --> 03:35.259
When school was over, you
would come to my grocery store.

03:35.283 --> 03:38.473
Zhang who sold sauce next door
would ask why you came here.

03:38.473 --> 03:40.443
You said you were here to pick up your dad.

03:40.443 --> 03:44.947
If you become a boss in the future,
you wouldn't let my dad sell rice.

03:46.283 --> 03:49.383
But you still want to open a grocery store now.

03:51.163 --> 03:52.443
Yes.

03:53.403 --> 03:56.083
I've been busy working all my life.

03:56.753 --> 04:00.489
It's boring to play every day.

04:01.003 --> 04:06.843
You can do housework,
cook and exercise with mom.

04:06.843 --> 04:08.515
That's quite enjoyable.

04:09.123 --> 04:10.193
Your spending is not too high.

04:10.193 --> 04:11.443
And you have deposits.

04:11.443 --> 04:14.483
My sister and I can totally support your life.

04:16.313 --> 04:17.593
Yes.

04:18.393 --> 04:21.361
Days pass like this.

04:22.003 --> 04:26.952
We're getting old and useless.

04:26.953 --> 04:29.777
How could you think that way?

04:30.273 --> 04:31.553
Who said that?

04:32.003 --> 04:33.153
Why did you say that?

04:33.153 --> 04:35.019
Everyone will get old.

04:35.043 --> 04:36.243
You're only sixty years old.

04:36.243 --> 04:37.443
You're still young.

04:37.443 --> 04:42.463
Since I'm still young, why wouldn't
you let me open a grocery store?

04:44.803 --> 04:48.072
Opening a grocery store
means you'll start a business.

04:48.073 --> 04:50.489
It's so stressful to start a business.

04:50.513 --> 04:51.793
Right?

04:52.003 --> 04:55.211
Once you decide it, you can't give up.

04:55.633 --> 05:00.329
You may think, it's easy
to open a grocery store.

05:00.633 --> 05:02.713
You only need a small shop front.

05:02.713 --> 05:06.369
But it's complicated to operate it, right?

05:06.393 --> 05:08.483
First, you need to buy a shop front.

05:08.483 --> 05:11.547
Then, the rent fee,

05:11.603 --> 05:13.513
the decoration fee.

05:13.513 --> 05:15.413
You also need to buy goods.

05:16.043 --> 05:18.051
What goods to buy,

05:18.313 --> 05:22.153
which source of goods is
cheaper, how to set the price,

05:22.153 --> 05:25.073
how much you need to sell to make a balance,

05:25.483 --> 05:27.623
have you thought of these, dad?

05:27.923 --> 05:31.393
It's not that I don't want you to work.

05:31.393 --> 05:34.709
I don't want you to open a grocery store.

05:38.603 --> 05:43.143
I've been the boss
of a grocery store for my whole life,

05:43.883 --> 05:45.879
what else can I do?

05:46.753 --> 05:48.883
Our community was hiring security guards.

05:48.883 --> 05:50.411
I asked about it,

05:50.563 --> 05:52.571
and they said I was too old.

05:53.683 --> 05:55.763
The parking lot of the company

05:56.073 --> 06:00.097
that Kexin's husband works in needed a guard.

06:00.273 --> 06:02.353
There is no limitation on age,

06:02.443 --> 06:04.343
but there is a night shift.

06:04.513 --> 06:06.869
I'm afraid I can't stay up late.

06:10.123 --> 06:10.833
Dad.

06:10.833 --> 06:12.889
My sister and I think,

06:14.193 --> 06:16.393
you've been working all your life.

06:16.393 --> 06:18.533
And you're sixty years old now.

06:18.923 --> 06:21.303
We want you to worry about nothing,

06:21.603 --> 06:22.903
and live happily.

06:23.633 --> 06:24.883
I'm happy.

06:24.883 --> 06:26.555
Of course, I'm happy.

06:27.243 --> 06:31.891
Well, we live in a peaceful age.

06:31.923 --> 06:34.923
Your mom and I are in harmony and healthy.

06:34.923 --> 06:36.513
You have filial piety.

06:36.513 --> 06:38.483
We won't worry about food or clothes.

06:38.483 --> 06:39.713
How could I not be happy?

06:39.713 --> 06:42.153
I'm very happy.

06:43.243 --> 06:48.002
But if I can find something to
do, and make some contributions,

06:48.003 --> 06:50.095
I would be happier.

06:51.603 --> 06:52.883
Okay.

06:53.603 --> 06:55.563
I'll think about it for you.

06:58.443 --> 07:00.451
[Xu Hongdou and Xu Hongmi]

07:01.803 --> 07:05.579
At that time, you were so little.

07:05.603 --> 07:07.323
But now...

07:12.073 --> 07:13.353
Dad.

07:13.883 --> 07:16.443
What do you think
if I start a business and be the boss?

07:16.443 --> 07:17.723
That's good.

07:17.803 --> 07:19.175
I'm serious.

07:20.003 --> 07:21.803
You want to open a grocery store as well?

07:21.803 --> 07:23.689
I won't.

07:23.713 --> 07:25.393
Why can't I open a big hotel?

07:25.393 --> 07:26.933
Of course, you can.

07:27.073 --> 07:28.613
I'm serious.

07:28.833 --> 07:30.659
I'm also serious.

07:30.683 --> 07:33.443
No matter what you do, I think you can make it.

07:33.443 --> 07:34.153
Really?

07:34.153 --> 07:35.433
Yes.

07:46.153 --> 07:47.243
Hello, Kexin.

07:47.243 --> 07:49.047
What do you want to eat?

07:57.633 --> 08:00.273
How can you let Kexin
pick up the packages herself?

08:00.273 --> 08:01.833
You're so foolish.

08:01.833 --> 08:03.633
What if anything happens?

08:03.633 --> 08:04.913
It's okay.

08:05.603 --> 08:06.713
Don't stand at the gate.

08:06.713 --> 08:08.683
Save my wife first!

08:08.683 --> 08:09.803
What did you say?

08:09.803 --> 08:11.483
There is no such rule here.

08:11.483 --> 08:12.923
We'll try to save them.

08:12.923 --> 08:13.953
How is she?

08:13.953 --> 08:16.489
Doctor, save both of them.

08:16.883 --> 08:17.564
Don't worry.

08:17.564 --> 08:18.983
Doctor.

08:19.803 --> 08:20.683
Don't worry.

08:20.683 --> 08:21.483
Sit down.

08:21.483 --> 08:22.763
Don't worry.

08:23.243 --> 08:24.759
[Operating]

08:27.417 --> 08:28.753
The doctor is here.

08:28.753 --> 08:30.736
Yang Kexin's relatives, here's the baby.

08:30.736 --> 08:31.963
Is the mom okay?

08:31.963 --> 08:32.674
Congratulations.

08:32.674 --> 08:34.274
Both of them are safe.

08:34.393 --> 08:35.963
Thank you.

08:35.963 --> 08:36.883
Hongdou.

08:36.883 --> 08:37.753
Hug her.

08:37.753 --> 08:38.753
Come on.

08:38.753 --> 08:39.603
Caisheng.

08:39.603 --> 08:41.563
Look at her.

08:42.203 --> 08:45.447
She's so cute.

08:45.963 --> 08:50.459
Your aunt and uncle went
to make nutritious meals for you.

08:50.483 --> 08:53.699
Your husband and mother went to pack things.

08:53.723 --> 08:56.553
Your parents went to have a check for the baby.

08:56.553 --> 08:58.393
They're fine, don't worry.

08:58.843 --> 09:00.123
Hongdou.

09:00.913 --> 09:04.753
Will the baby injure because I fell?

09:04.753 --> 09:06.203
The baby is good.

09:06.203 --> 09:10.359
Although it didn't reach the
expected date, the baby is mature.

09:10.603 --> 09:12.673
And you had an operation once you arrived here.

09:12.673 --> 09:14.153
She won't lack oxygen.

09:14.153 --> 09:15.433
Don't worry.

09:18.553 --> 09:21.953
You really scared me when you called me.

09:22.753 --> 09:25.337
It's like you were dying.

09:25.793 --> 09:28.869
I didn't know if I would be okay then.

09:29.483 --> 09:31.395
If anything happened,

09:31.513 --> 09:33.323
I didn't have the chance to say it.

09:33.323 --> 09:35.769
When I was waiting for the ambulance,

09:35.793 --> 09:40.021
I thought a lot.

09:40.603 --> 09:42.529
I didn't want anything else.

09:42.553 --> 09:44.177
It's good to be alive.

09:45.083 --> 09:47.331
I argued with my mom yesterday.

09:47.513 --> 09:49.185
I regretted it.

09:50.393 --> 09:52.489
The baby is not too big,

09:52.513 --> 09:54.819
the position of the fetus is okay.

09:54.843 --> 09:58.273
And I bought a
constellation bracelet for her.

09:58.273 --> 10:00.809
I wanted to have a normal childbirth.

10:02.483 --> 10:03.855
It's useless now.

10:04.033 --> 10:06.197
I prepared nothing well.

10:06.673 --> 10:10.409
Many things may happen when you're not ready.

10:10.433 --> 10:11.973
Don't think too much.

10:12.433 --> 10:13.713
Have some rest.

10:16.913 --> 10:19.113
Is your sister okay now?

10:19.273 --> 10:20.553
She's fine.

10:21.273 --> 10:23.533
You didn't see my relatives then.

10:24.123 --> 10:26.793
This is the first time
that I saw them panic like this.

10:26.793 --> 10:30.385
My aunt can't even stand.

10:31.633 --> 10:33.473
You're also scared, right?

10:33.553 --> 10:34.843
Of course.

10:34.843 --> 10:37.753
She suddenly called me
and I felt like she was dying.

10:37.753 --> 10:40.579
I was scared the hell out of myself by her.

10:40.603 --> 10:42.311
I can't even sleep now.

10:42.393 --> 10:43.729
I'm scared.

10:45.433 --> 10:46.713
Or,

10:47.843 --> 10:49.683
I can fly to you tomorrow.

10:51.433 --> 10:52.973
Why do you come here?

10:54.513 --> 10:55.793
I...

10:56.723 --> 10:58.383
I just want to see you.

11:05.003 --> 11:06.663
I was just kidding.

11:06.753 --> 11:10.083
I just sent away
the team-building company you recommended to me.

11:10.083 --> 11:12.273
And I've been selling potatoes recently.

11:12.273 --> 11:14.377
I'm busy now.

11:19.603 --> 11:20.883
You're kidding?

11:33.083 --> 11:35.603
If I need you in Beijing, will you come?

11:35.603 --> 11:36.883
Of course.

11:38.433 --> 11:39.433
I'm serious.

11:39.433 --> 11:40.713
I'm not kidding.

11:49.203 --> 11:50.203
Go to work.

11:50.203 --> 11:51.483
Sleep early.

11:53.033 --> 11:54.083
Okay.

11:54.083 --> 11:55.843
Don't think too much.

11:55.843 --> 11:58.883
You need to take care of your sister tomorrow.

11:59.723 --> 12:01.003
Well,

12:01.153 --> 12:04.033
the plums you gave me
became sweeter after some days.

12:04.033 --> 12:05.313
It's delicious.

12:08.963 --> 12:10.507
It might hurt your stomach if you eat too much.

12:10.507 --> 12:11.994
Don't eat too much.

12:15.433 --> 12:16.713
Goodbye.

13:05.553 --> 13:06.833
Xie!

13:07.033 --> 13:08.243
Xie!

13:08.243 --> 13:09.153
Wake up!

13:09.153 --> 13:10.433
Come on!

13:10.843 --> 13:11.274
What?

13:11.274 --> 13:12.669
What happened?

13:13.393 --> 13:14.979
Calm down and tell me.

13:15.003 --> 13:15.673
What's wrong?

13:15.673 --> 13:16.963
We made it!

13:16.963 --> 13:18.243
What?

13:18.243 --> 13:19.203
The bookstore.

13:19.203 --> 13:20.963
The bookstore just called me.

13:20.963 --> 13:21.963
We made it.

13:21.963 --> 13:22.603
We made it?

13:22.603 --> 13:23.273
Yes!

13:23.273 --> 13:23.753
Really?

13:23.753 --> 13:25.033
Yes!

13:28.243 --> 13:29.513
We made it!

13:29.513 --> 13:31.003
I'll take off these first.

13:31.003 --> 13:34.835
We must eat something to celebrate it tonight.

13:37.603 --> 13:38.883
Really?

13:39.433 --> 13:40.713
Really?

13:42.033 --> 13:43.313
That's great.

13:43.843 --> 13:45.123
You made it.

13:45.723 --> 13:46.323
Yes.

13:46.323 --> 13:47.753
We finally made it.

13:47.753 --> 13:49.677
Congratulations.

13:52.203 --> 13:54.003
I should also say that to you.

13:54.003 --> 13:56.099
You also contributed.

13:56.123 --> 13:57.513
You contributed more.

13:57.513 --> 14:01.165
You made Yunmiao Village a beautiful one.

14:07.153 --> 14:08.433
Xu Hongdou.

14:11.003 --> 14:14.129
If, I mean if,

14:14.153 --> 14:16.729
after the bookstore was built,

14:16.753 --> 14:19.059
and there are more prospects here,

14:19.083 --> 14:22.393
after the hotels
and homestay hotels were built here,

14:22.393 --> 14:26.525
and everything becomes better, can you

14:27.553 --> 14:31.577
consider moving and working here?

14:36.083 --> 14:37.707
What can I do then?

14:40.033 --> 14:44.153
There is nothing here now, and
the future is not bright for sure.

14:44.153 --> 14:45.633
I mean the future.

14:47.153 --> 14:50.883
♫ There are stars on the way ♫

14:50.883 --> 14:54.380
Of course, it's okay if you
don't want to come here.

14:54.433 --> 14:59.033
You will have a better life in
Beijing, and there are more chances.

14:59.033 --> 15:00.765
I was just asking.

15:03.153 --> 15:04.633
I'll think about it.

15:05.142 --> 15:07.243
♫ I flipped several times ♫

15:07.243 --> 15:08.523
Really?

15:09.883 --> 15:11.399
Unlike you,

15:11.603 --> 15:13.683
I won't joke with you all day.

15:14.433 --> 15:16.673
I didn't do that all day.

15:16.673 --> 15:18.069
Don't say that.

15:18.123 --> 15:19.913
Well, I have nothing to say.

15:19.913 --> 15:22.077
I didn't eat my breakfast yet.

15:22.963 --> 15:23.843
Okay.

15:23.843 --> 15:25.503
I'll continue to sleep.

15:26.083 --> 15:27.123
Sorry to interrupt you.

15:27.123 --> 15:28.553
Continue to sleep.

15:28.553 --> 15:29.833
Bye-bye.

15:32.283 --> 15:36.780
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

15:36.804 --> 15:40.033
♫ I'll still love it as when I was young ♫

15:40.033 --> 15:41.033
God blesses me.

15:41.033 --> 15:45.117
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

15:45.425 --> 15:49.661
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

15:49.685 --> 15:55.051
♫ Maybe things would happen as I wish ♫

16:13.323 --> 16:15.223
Mom, five more minutes.

16:18.203 --> 16:19.393
I won't eat breakfast.

16:19.393 --> 16:20.673
Five minutes.

16:25.003 --> 16:26.513
What are you doing?

16:26.513 --> 16:27.793
Stop.

16:27.793 --> 16:30.033
Mom, she'll sleep until noon every day.

16:30.033 --> 16:31.323
Why don't you say something?

16:31.323 --> 16:33.913
She has been companying Kexin in the hospital.

16:33.913 --> 16:35.273
She slept late last night.

16:35.273 --> 16:36.673
Just let her be.

16:36.673 --> 16:37.793
Come on.

16:37.793 --> 16:38.963
Hongmi, have breakfast.

16:38.963 --> 16:40.393
When did you come back?

16:40.393 --> 16:41.981
Why can't I go back?

16:42.483 --> 16:45.299
After I moved, I heard Kexin fall,

16:45.323 --> 16:48.729
so I came back at
weekend, and educate you.

16:48.753 --> 16:49.603
Where is Lingdang?

16:49.603 --> 16:50.883
She's not here.

16:52.433 --> 16:54.033
Wake up.

16:54.033 --> 16:55.203
Wake up.

16:55.203 --> 16:58.323
Company me to the hospital
to visit Kexin after lunch.

16:58.323 --> 16:59.603
Five minutes.

16:59.603 --> 17:00.883
No, wake up.

17:00.883 --> 17:03.043
Enough, the noodles are lumping.

17:03.043 --> 17:04.083
Come here.

17:04.083 --> 17:04.993
Come on.

17:04.993 --> 17:06.123
Wake up.

17:06.123 --> 17:08.393
You lazy pig.

17:08.393 --> 17:08.914
Mom.

17:08.914 --> 17:11.234
This pig is ready to be eaten now.

17:11.323 --> 17:12.603
Wake up.

17:25.283 --> 17:26.563
On that day,

17:26.633 --> 17:29.739
Dou and your dad went to the old house to clean.

17:29.763 --> 17:31.843
Your aunt cried to call me.

17:31.843 --> 17:33.371
She said Kexin fell.

17:33.673 --> 17:37.217
I was shocked, and my
heart was beating fast.

17:38.083 --> 17:40.633
Kexin's husband panicked.

17:40.633 --> 17:43.181
He acted like a fool in the hospital.

17:43.393 --> 17:45.053
Luckily, Dou was there.

17:45.083 --> 17:46.953
The whole family panicked.

17:46.953 --> 17:49.873
Dou said nothing and helped them a lot.

17:51.563 --> 17:54.039
She grew up to be useful now.

17:54.123 --> 17:56.935
Yes, she should grow up.

17:57.633 --> 17:59.969
Your mom is an expert in cooking.

17:59.993 --> 18:02.233
It's a pity that
you didn't open a restaurant, right?

18:02.233 --> 18:04.193
- Absolutely.
- Don't eat too fast.

18:04.193 --> 18:05.393
Don't eat too much.

18:05.393 --> 18:06.233
The blood sugar is high.

18:06.233 --> 18:07.905
You can eat more.

18:07.953 --> 18:08.953
I'll eat less, I'm on a diet.

18:08.953 --> 18:10.349
Eat more.

18:12.043 --> 18:13.943
She is smiling.

18:25.473 --> 18:26.753
She fell asleep?

18:27.193 --> 18:30.129
It has been a long time since I cuddled a baby.

18:30.153 --> 18:31.713
Well done, Hongmi.

18:31.713 --> 18:33.283
Hongdou doesn't dare to hug her.

18:33.283 --> 18:34.763
She said she's too small and soft.

18:34.763 --> 18:36.603
She is afraid to hurt her.

18:37.123 --> 18:40.633
What if the customers in your hotel
want you to hug the baby?

18:40.633 --> 18:42.413
Just do it.

18:44.393 --> 18:46.749
Well, Hongmi,

18:48.283 --> 18:50.913
have you watched the promotional video
Hongdou helped to film

18:50.913 --> 18:53.763
when she was playing in Yunnan?

18:53.763 --> 18:55.087
Yes, what?

18:55.843 --> 18:58.319
Have you seen the guy

18:58.603 --> 19:00.983
that holds her hand at the seaside?

19:01.233 --> 19:03.013
What do you think of him?

19:04.953 --> 19:06.253
Just so-so.

19:08.603 --> 19:10.791
I think he is handsome.

19:11.123 --> 19:12.687
He is too poor.

19:12.803 --> 19:14.083
Poor?

19:14.603 --> 19:17.943
He is starting a business,
and you know that.

19:18.713 --> 19:21.297
He is doing business well.

19:22.083 --> 19:26.211
When you were there, he
took good care of you, right?

19:26.233 --> 19:28.157
And you said he is poor.

19:28.323 --> 19:30.083
There is something wrong with you.

19:30.083 --> 19:30.914
I just said he is poor.

19:30.914 --> 19:32.729
Why are you so angry?

19:33.193 --> 19:35.201
I just think you're wrong.

19:35.393 --> 19:37.365
Why can't I say that?

19:40.393 --> 19:41.803
Why are you aggressive?

19:41.803 --> 19:44.039
Am I aggressive?

19:45.633 --> 19:47.413
Am I aggressive?

19:47.953 --> 19:49.563
Am I aggressive?

19:49.563 --> 19:50.935
I'll keep quiet.

19:52.083 --> 19:53.455
That's funny.

20:00.953 --> 20:02.961
Come and help me, okay?

20:03.083 --> 20:03.804
Do it yourself.

20:03.804 --> 20:05.751
I'm busy with work.

20:11.083 --> 20:12.363
The bookstore?

20:13.603 --> 20:16.163
They will select a site in a few days.

20:16.953 --> 20:18.973
It's good to have a business.

20:19.913 --> 20:23.499
After you settled the bookstore
issue, you became better.

20:23.523 --> 20:25.609
What were you doing before?

20:25.633 --> 20:26.603
You were strange.

20:26.603 --> 20:27.803
I'm not used to it.

20:27.803 --> 20:29.703
Just get used to it.

20:30.713 --> 20:32.253
Let me tell you,

20:32.283 --> 20:33.991
I have a feeling,

20:34.603 --> 20:39.635
after I work hard for two years,
when the bookstore was built,

20:39.953 --> 20:41.589
I'll get married.

20:43.393 --> 20:44.633
What?

20:44.633 --> 20:46.083
After the bookstore was built,

20:46.083 --> 20:48.193
the village committee will give you a wife?

20:48.193 --> 20:49.393
That's right.

20:49.393 --> 20:51.365
God will give me a wife.

20:53.993 --> 20:55.603
I just said you are better.

20:55.603 --> 20:57.143
Are you insane again?

20:57.603 --> 20:59.883
Xu Hongdou has been gone for long.

20:59.883 --> 21:01.283
You are still insane.

21:01.283 --> 21:02.764
It's none of your business.

21:02.764 --> 21:04.043
I won't bother to do that.

21:04.043 --> 21:05.083
Uncle Yao.

21:05.083 --> 21:06.363
Guanjun.

21:12.283 --> 21:13.633
Am I pretty?

21:13.633 --> 21:15.533
My boyfriend gave it to me.

21:16.466 --> 21:18.066
Another insane person.

21:19.563 --> 21:20.843
It's pretty.

21:22.393 --> 21:24.283
Uncle Yao, will you treat us to a meal today?

21:24.283 --> 21:25.563
Yes.

21:26.523 --> 21:27.803
Qin,

21:27.883 --> 21:29.713
didn't you break up with Yang Zhinan?

21:29.713 --> 21:30.993
No.

21:31.713 --> 21:33.061
Why not?

21:34.603 --> 21:37.153
Lovers will argue.

21:37.153 --> 21:39.433
If you don't argue and break up with each other,

21:39.433 --> 21:43.133
it would be boring to have a plain relationship.

21:44.283 --> 21:47.011
But this might hurt your feelings.

21:47.083 --> 21:49.715
Love should be tested.

21:49.913 --> 21:50.434
Forget it.

21:50.434 --> 21:51.883
Why would I tell you this?

21:51.883 --> 21:53.433
You won't understand.

21:53.433 --> 21:54.883
Am I right, Uncle Yao?

21:54.883 --> 21:55.843
Yes.

21:55.843 --> 21:59.043
Love should be tested by difficulties,

21:59.043 --> 22:00.473
but you can't test it too often.

22:00.473 --> 22:02.553
Don't often break up with him.

22:02.883 --> 22:04.663
You asked me to break up.

22:04.803 --> 22:06.153
You'll do as I said?

22:06.153 --> 22:08.413
Why don't you listen to your dad?

22:09.393 --> 22:13.762
I said that to let him
realize the seriousness of the problem.

22:13.763 --> 22:17.967
Besides, I was angry, and
didn't mean to break up.

22:18.123 --> 22:21.993
After all, Yang Zhinan is so handsome and nice.

22:21.993 --> 22:24.205
I can't give him to others.

22:25.153 --> 22:26.441
He is so good?

22:26.953 --> 22:28.523
Have you seen him, Yao?

22:28.523 --> 22:29.633
Yes.

22:29.633 --> 22:30.913
He looks...

22:31.193 --> 22:32.473
okay.

22:33.393 --> 22:34.803
He is not just okay.

22:34.803 --> 22:35.913
He is handsome.

22:35.913 --> 22:37.453
He looks like a star.

22:37.633 --> 22:38.943
Which star?

22:38.943 --> 22:40.843
It's none of your business.

22:43.523 --> 22:44.523
Uncle Yao.

22:44.523 --> 22:46.283
Don't give up.

22:46.283 --> 22:50.193
Although you're old and have
dark skin, you should believe,

22:50.193 --> 22:53.649
even the wild lilies also have spring.

22:53.673 --> 22:57.373
You can have beautiful love just like me.

22:57.563 --> 22:59.175
Beautiful love?

22:59.433 --> 23:02.579
Obviously, your Uncle Yao is insane now.

23:02.603 --> 23:04.383
He is insane about women.

23:04.803 --> 23:07.603
He was imagining, after
the bookstore was built,

23:07.603 --> 23:10.449
the village committee would give him a wife.

23:10.473 --> 23:12.925
I have a hunch and confidence.

23:13.043 --> 23:15.123
After the bookstore was built,

23:15.283 --> 23:17.099
I'll be married.

23:17.673 --> 23:18.883
See?

23:18.883 --> 23:20.163
Isn't he insane?

24:03.523 --> 24:05.673
This has been put off for too long.

24:05.673 --> 24:07.333
Give it to me tomorrow.

24:14.563 --> 24:15.673
What are you doing?

24:15.673 --> 24:16.523
What are you doing?

24:16.523 --> 24:16.994
Let me go.

24:16.994 --> 24:17.883
Bring me back my shoes.

24:17.883 --> 24:18.523
No.

24:18.523 --> 24:19.233
No?

24:19.233 --> 24:20.603
Do it or not?

24:20.603 --> 24:21.193
Okay.

24:21.193 --> 24:21.763
Do it or not?

24:21.763 --> 24:22.393
Okay.

24:22.393 --> 24:23.083
I'll do it.

24:23.083 --> 24:24.363
Let me go.

24:27.843 --> 24:29.407
Xu Hongmi.

24:34.713 --> 24:35.713
Xu Hongdou.

24:35.713 --> 24:36.993
Xu Hongdou.

24:37.883 --> 24:42.471
Before I find a place to bury
you, bring me back my shoes.

24:42.843 --> 24:43.883
Five.

24:43.883 --> 24:44.883
Four.

24:44.883 --> 24:45.883
Three.

24:45.883 --> 24:46.883
Two.

24:46.883 --> 24:48.163
One.

24:51.433 --> 24:53.043
Dumplings again?

24:53.043 --> 24:54.083
Your sister is back.

24:54.083 --> 24:56.123
Of course, we should eat dumplings.

24:56.123 --> 24:57.433
I'll help you with it.

24:57.433 --> 24:58.523
No need.

24:58.523 --> 25:00.123
Play with your sister.

25:00.123 --> 25:00.843
She?

25:00.843 --> 25:03.139
She is going to bury me.

25:03.393 --> 25:04.673
Bury you here.

25:05.193 --> 25:08.393
Your ages total to about 70 years old.

25:08.393 --> 25:10.653
Why do you still act like kids?

25:15.883 --> 25:18.123
Your ages total to about 100 years old.

25:18.123 --> 25:19.403
You're the same.

25:19.673 --> 25:21.393
Mom, what are you doing?

25:21.843 --> 25:23.153
I can't live with your dad anymore.

25:23.153 --> 25:24.933
You can choose one of us.

25:26.123 --> 25:27.447
You argued again?

25:27.603 --> 25:28.673
I choose sister.

25:28.673 --> 25:29.953
Go away.

25:30.883 --> 25:32.043
Dad.

25:32.043 --> 25:33.583
What are you arguing?

25:36.283 --> 25:38.433
I said I wouldn't open a grocery store.

25:38.433 --> 25:40.193
I just want to work outside.

25:40.193 --> 25:41.625
She is still angry.

25:41.843 --> 25:43.851
Work outside?

25:46.713 --> 25:47.993
Meeting time.

25:53.603 --> 25:56.031
I just want to work.

25:56.883 --> 25:57.563
Okay.

25:57.563 --> 25:58.843
Here.

26:00.603 --> 26:01.473
President.

26:01.473 --> 26:02.773
Here is your tea.

26:09.283 --> 26:10.763
The meeting begins.

26:10.993 --> 26:12.523
Liu.

26:12.523 --> 26:13.323
You opposed it the most.

26:13.323 --> 26:14.233
Say it first.

26:14.233 --> 26:15.773
What did you call me?

26:16.233 --> 26:17.821
Be careful, it's hot.

26:17.953 --> 26:19.233
Please say it.

26:19.393 --> 26:21.113
Okay, I'll say it first.

26:21.913 --> 26:23.193
Xu Jianguo,

26:23.473 --> 26:25.523
we have a clear division of labor.

26:25.523 --> 26:26.843
You work outside and I work inside.

26:26.843 --> 26:28.523
We have elders and children to raise.

26:28.523 --> 26:30.393
We support the whole family together.

26:30.393 --> 26:33.393
No, you support more and I support less.

26:33.393 --> 26:34.803
Don't be humble.

26:34.803 --> 26:36.913
You paid a lot for this family.

26:36.913 --> 26:38.763
We can see that.

26:38.763 --> 26:40.233
You sold grains and oil.

26:40.233 --> 26:42.633
How much can you earn from a bag of rice?

26:42.633 --> 26:44.673
You just wanted to save money.

26:44.673 --> 26:45.953
You never hired others.

26:45.953 --> 26:47.633
You unloaded all goods yourself.

26:47.633 --> 26:49.713
You worked from day to night. Then what?

26:49.713 --> 26:52.059
You have a problem with your waist.

26:52.083 --> 26:53.283
You're right.

26:53.283 --> 26:54.895
My waist...

26:57.283 --> 26:59.393
Why are you praising me now?

26:59.393 --> 27:00.763
Of course, I should praise you.

27:00.763 --> 27:02.433
I should praise you if you do well.

27:02.433 --> 27:03.473
You should be praised.

27:03.473 --> 27:05.323
I'm just being honest.

27:05.323 --> 27:09.763
I've always been fair, just and... Open.

27:09.763 --> 27:11.043
Open.

27:11.563 --> 27:14.323
You were poor,
and didn't graduate from junior high.

27:14.323 --> 27:14.913
Why?

27:14.913 --> 27:17.433
You wanted to earn money, so you went to work.

27:17.433 --> 27:18.473
But I'm different.

27:18.473 --> 27:19.803
I graduated from a technical school.

27:19.803 --> 27:23.911
At that time, I'm the
most literate person.

27:24.233 --> 27:28.113
When the neighbors met conflicts,

27:28.153 --> 27:29.913
they would let me judge it.

27:29.913 --> 27:31.213
Mom is the best.

27:32.673 --> 27:34.763
So how could I wrong you?

27:34.763 --> 27:36.123
Yes, you're right.

27:36.393 --> 27:38.673
I can understand you want to work outside.

27:38.673 --> 27:41.929
But I don't want to worry about you anymore.

27:41.953 --> 27:43.283
Look at your waist.

27:43.283 --> 27:45.953
There was a time when you couldn't
sit or stand because of the pain.

27:45.953 --> 27:47.883
I went to the hospital with you.

27:47.883 --> 27:50.713
You had acupuncture
and I brought medicine for you.

27:50.713 --> 27:54.153
When you were in the hospital,
I rented a spring bed.

27:54.153 --> 27:56.433
I lived in the corridor of the hospital.

27:56.433 --> 27:57.473
It was winter.

27:57.473 --> 27:59.193
The wind was so big.

27:59.193 --> 28:01.933
I had a fever when you were living there.

28:02.083 --> 28:05.059
You should call and tell us.

28:05.083 --> 28:07.193
It's useless.

28:07.193 --> 28:09.713
You were working far away.

28:09.713 --> 28:13.209
Why would I bother to let you come back?

28:13.433 --> 28:14.843
Think about it, Xu Jianguo.

28:14.843 --> 28:16.659
We're getting old now.

28:16.713 --> 28:21.993
If we are healthy and happy, it
is supporting their career, right?

28:21.993 --> 28:23.323
Yes.

28:23.323 --> 28:26.759
So I won't open a grocery store.

28:27.123 --> 28:31.523
Dou analyzed it for me and criticized me.

28:31.523 --> 28:35.083
I admit I thought it was easy at that time.

28:35.083 --> 28:37.154
You are old now, what can you do?

28:37.154 --> 28:39.913
A security guard needs
to be less than 45 years old.

28:39.913 --> 28:41.777
You're too old for that.

28:42.193 --> 28:43.633
What can you do now?

28:43.633 --> 28:46.153
Being a guard in the
warehouse, burning the boiler?

28:46.153 --> 28:47.633
These are night shifts.

28:47.633 --> 28:49.433
How can you do that?

28:49.433 --> 28:53.073
The money you earned can't cover
the medical bills.

28:53.843 --> 28:56.803
Dad, you can't do the work
that will harm your body.

28:56.803 --> 29:00.473
But I think Dad can still do something now.

29:00.473 --> 29:02.733
Listen to what Dou said.

29:03.193 --> 29:04.493
I...

29:04.803 --> 29:08.815
I can rent some fields in the
countryside, and plant something.

29:09.153 --> 29:10.913
You think you can do that?

29:10.913 --> 29:12.803
Look at the garlic
you planted in the flower pot.

29:12.803 --> 29:13.634
Did it grow?

29:13.634 --> 29:15.413
Did it?

29:15.953 --> 29:19.153
I was born in a peasant family.

29:19.153 --> 29:20.523
You can't plant in the field.

29:20.523 --> 29:22.563
You need to bend and plant.

29:22.563 --> 29:24.343
It would harm your waist.

29:24.433 --> 29:25.713
But,

29:25.803 --> 29:28.279
I can do nothing else.

29:28.603 --> 29:30.633
I can only sell grains for my life.

29:30.633 --> 29:31.434
Don't be so humble.

29:31.434 --> 29:33.249
You can also eat grains.

29:33.913 --> 29:34.675
We're having a meeting.

29:34.675 --> 29:36.283
Why are you being so aggressive?

29:36.283 --> 29:37.803
You can't say that, Guiqin.

29:37.803 --> 29:39.233
You are saying that I'm a pig.

29:39.233 --> 29:40.843
You... I oppose that.

29:40.843 --> 29:41.803
Opposition is sustained.

29:41.803 --> 29:44.375
Mom, don't be so aggressive.

29:44.523 --> 29:45.953
Okay, okay, I won't say that.

29:45.953 --> 29:47.843
You two, listen carefully.

29:47.843 --> 29:51.803
If there is a free and suitable
job for you, I support you to work.

29:51.803 --> 29:52.603
Okay.

29:52.603 --> 29:56.193
But, if it hurts your body,
or is bad for your health,

29:56.193 --> 29:57.733
that's absolutely no.

30:03.123 --> 30:06.803
Mom, let's work towards this target.

30:06.803 --> 30:08.473
We should think of a solution.

30:08.473 --> 30:09.913
Yes, think of a solution.

30:09.913 --> 30:12.603
But, dad, don't have much hope for it.

30:12.603 --> 30:15.169
Then why did you say that?

30:15.193 --> 30:21.043
Dad, our owner committee
needs a volunteer.

30:21.043 --> 30:22.323
No.

30:22.323 --> 30:23.983
I want to make money.

30:24.123 --> 30:25.083
See?

30:25.083 --> 30:26.153
A miser.

30:26.153 --> 30:27.933
Let's cook the dumplings.

30:28.193 --> 30:30.283
Wait.

30:30.283 --> 30:34.703
Since my sister is also here
today, I have something to tell you.

30:35.153 --> 30:36.883
What is it? So mysterious.

30:36.883 --> 30:38.428
It's not a good thing.

30:38.428 --> 30:39.043
Just listen to her.

30:39.043 --> 30:40.323
Let her tell us.

30:41.883 --> 30:43.183
Dad, mom, sister.

30:43.393 --> 30:47.762
After thorough consideration,
and it's not just a whim,

30:47.763 --> 30:50.209
I want to Seize the day.

30:50.233 --> 30:53.153
And, this is what I want to do the most.

30:53.153 --> 30:54.763
I think it's meaningful,

30:54.763 --> 30:57.233
is a good opportunity and has great prospects.

30:57.233 --> 30:58.393
Don't say too much.

30:58.393 --> 30:59.393
Just tell us.

30:59.393 --> 31:01.193
Just let me tell you my thoughts first.

31:01.193 --> 31:02.625
Okay, just say it.

31:04.993 --> 31:07.293
Dear families, I...

31:07.673 --> 31:10.833
don't want to go back to work
in Beijing for now.

31:12.563 --> 31:17.369
I want to buy and run
the homestay hotel in Yunmiao Village.

31:17.393 --> 31:21.713
According to reliable information,
the transfer price is cheap.

31:21.713 --> 31:24.633
And there will be a Shaohua Bookstore
next to it.

31:24.633 --> 31:26.523
It's the perfect time to buy the hotel now.

31:26.523 --> 31:28.393
My major is hotel management.

31:28.393 --> 31:30.473
I'm good at it.

31:30.473 --> 31:34.641
I've found a partner that will buy it with me.

31:34.673 --> 31:37.017
We discussed and calculated it.

31:37.043 --> 31:40.239
We can pay the early expense.

31:41.043 --> 31:43.913
As for the future plan, we
need some time to design it.

31:43.913 --> 31:45.969
I won't say that now.

31:51.043 --> 31:55.602
Well, you said, you even
found a partner with you, right?

31:55.603 --> 31:59.123
My VIP customer, Qiu, she knows
about homestay hotel brand building.

31:59.123 --> 32:00.222
And she is doing well.

32:00.222 --> 32:02.153
She opened many hotels,
and wants me to join her.

32:02.153 --> 32:02.913
I didn't agree.

32:02.913 --> 32:03.673
Why?

32:03.673 --> 32:05.393
Because I want to build my own brand.

32:05.393 --> 32:06.843
We have different ideas.

32:06.843 --> 32:09.367
Then I found another partner.

32:09.713 --> 32:12.393
About the idea, I won't tell you now.

32:12.393 --> 32:14.913
After I finish the plan, I'll show you.

32:14.913 --> 32:15.883
Is the money enough?

32:15.883 --> 32:16.993
Yes.

32:16.993 --> 32:18.043
Let's cook the dumplings.

32:18.043 --> 32:19.343
I'll peel garlic.

32:27.763 --> 32:29.519
Xu Hongdou.

32:29.763 --> 32:33.703
No wonder you found a boyfriend
through Internet drift bottle.

32:35.123 --> 32:36.153
Mom.

32:36.153 --> 32:37.763
I want vegetable dumplings.

32:37.763 --> 32:39.043
Okay.

32:39.433 --> 32:42.283
Can you cook dumplings with the pot
that cooks steamed stuffed bun?

32:42.283 --> 32:43.633
See?

32:43.633 --> 32:45.713
I can distinguish which dumpling is made by mom.

32:45.713 --> 32:47.433
The dumplings are like humans.

32:47.433 --> 32:50.283
Your dad is stingy, so he made small dumplings.

32:50.283 --> 32:51.843
No way, I think he made this one.

32:51.843 --> 32:53.393
See the shelf he made.

32:53.393 --> 32:54.873
How can I reach it?

32:54.913 --> 32:56.283
He needs to reach every bowl himself.

32:56.283 --> 32:58.147
He deserves it.

32:59.123 --> 33:00.403
I'll help you.

33:00.713 --> 33:02.953
Where is the pepper and chili sauce I bought?

33:02.953 --> 33:03.233
Mom.

33:03.233 --> 33:03.993
It's here.

33:03.993 --> 33:05.633
Do you agree?

33:05.633 --> 33:09.477
Let me tell you, you should
make the sauce delicious.

33:09.763 --> 33:11.563
Where is the chili sauce I bought?

33:11.563 --> 33:12.323
I know where it is.

33:12.323 --> 33:12.884
It's here.

33:12.884 --> 33:14.323
Put more chili sauce.

33:14.323 --> 33:15.983
It will be delicious.

33:21.043 --> 33:22.655
It's delicious.

33:23.843 --> 33:27.393
Although your mom was angry,
she didn't put more salt.

33:27.393 --> 33:29.077
She should be praised.

33:29.393 --> 33:31.034
Who was angry?

33:31.034 --> 33:33.036
I didn't want to talk with you.

33:33.036 --> 33:36.969
Mom, you put dried small shrimps
in the leek stuffing?

33:36.993 --> 33:40.633
If you put shrimp meat or dried shrimps,
it wouldn't be delicious.

33:40.633 --> 33:41.563
It's delicious.

33:41.563 --> 33:42.843
Eat more.

33:42.993 --> 33:44.293
Well,

33:46.473 --> 33:49.929
about opening a homestay
hotel, what do you think?

33:49.953 --> 33:50.913
Dou.

33:50.913 --> 33:52.523
Talk less when having meals.

33:52.523 --> 33:54.099
Eat more, here.

33:54.393 --> 33:55.681
Eat some beef.

33:56.283 --> 33:57.233
Mom.

33:57.233 --> 33:58.153
Here.

33:58.153 --> 33:58.993
Delicious?

33:58.993 --> 34:00.293
Yes.

34:00.843 --> 34:01.713
So tasty.

34:01.713 --> 34:03.593
Your mom is such an expert.

34:03.593 --> 34:08.853
Guiqin, it would be a pity...
If I didn't open a restaurant.

34:10.393 --> 34:11.673
So comfortable.

34:12.593 --> 34:16.113
It needs to cover all around your face.

34:16.113 --> 34:17.929
Then it will be useful.

34:19.553 --> 34:23.289
It's so refreshing and comfortable.

34:25.843 --> 34:27.123
Do you want it?

34:27.763 --> 34:29.043
She has that.

34:30.993 --> 34:34.021
How could she buy so expensive face masks?

34:38.283 --> 34:44.705
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

34:44.705 --> 34:48.913
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

34:48.913 --> 34:49.843
Mom.

34:49.843 --> 34:51.643
Let her do it herself.

34:51.643 --> 34:53.883
No one is as expert as she is.

34:53.883 --> 34:55.433
Right, she majored in it.

34:55.433 --> 34:56.713
Yes.

34:57.203 --> 34:59.463
I didn't major in making the bed.

35:01.243 --> 35:02.903
You're angry.

35:03.073 --> 35:03.724
Okay, okay.

35:03.724 --> 35:04.763
Don't be angry.

35:04.763 --> 35:06.513
Mom, what do you want to show me?

35:06.513 --> 35:07.164
It's in my room.

35:07.164 --> 35:08.433
My new bedside table.

35:08.433 --> 35:09.713
Here.

35:09.803 --> 35:12.243
What's nice about the bedside table?

35:33.953 --> 35:36.139
You... What are you doing?

35:36.163 --> 35:37.703
Why didn't you sleep?

35:38.283 --> 35:39.895
I can't fall asleep.

35:43.113 --> 35:44.533
It's three o'clock.

35:45.913 --> 35:47.243
What do you think?

35:47.243 --> 35:48.723
Think of what?

35:49.323 --> 35:50.763
The homestay hotel.

35:50.763 --> 35:52.099
Ask mom.

35:52.433 --> 35:53.865
So annoying.

36:08.243 --> 36:09.363
What is it?

36:09.363 --> 36:11.283
Xu Jianguo, there is a ghost catching my foot.

36:11.283 --> 36:12.243
What's wrong?

36:12.243 --> 36:13.363
What is it?

36:13.363 --> 36:14.699
Oh my god.

36:16.113 --> 36:17.513
Xu Hongdou.

36:17.513 --> 36:18.643
You naughty girl.

36:18.643 --> 36:20.323
Why are you squatting there?

36:20.323 --> 36:21.935
You scared me.

36:30.433 --> 36:31.733
Drink some milk.

36:33.513 --> 36:35.163
What are you doing?

36:35.163 --> 36:37.111
Can't you see that,

36:38.323 --> 36:42.875
we ignored you on purpose, and
tease you to make you anxious?

36:46.593 --> 36:50.629
Do you know what mom called to tell me?

36:51.243 --> 36:52.523
She said,

36:53.913 --> 36:57.139
Dou became wild after she went out.

36:57.163 --> 37:00.113
When she mentioned the
friends there, she was very happy.

37:00.113 --> 37:04.113
And the one who wants to start
a business with her, that one is...

37:04.113 --> 37:04.993
Xie.

37:04.993 --> 37:06.293
Yes, Xie.

37:06.723 --> 37:10.603
They would send peaches and plums to each other.

37:10.683 --> 37:13.507
Their relationship is close, so close.

37:13.683 --> 37:15.163
They are still so close?

37:15.163 --> 37:16.723
It's been a long time.

37:16.723 --> 37:17.394
That's right.

37:17.394 --> 37:20.843
She even asked Li Yulin
to lead tourists there and make plans.

37:20.843 --> 37:23.523
They even called each other at midnight.

37:23.763 --> 37:29.023
Let me tell you, I
think they'll be together.

37:29.763 --> 37:31.147
Really?

37:31.393 --> 37:34.565
I know what she wants to do once she moves.

37:36.033 --> 37:37.643
Do you agree?

37:37.643 --> 37:38.394
Yes.

37:38.394 --> 37:39.803
Of course.

37:39.803 --> 37:42.553
As long as she likes
him, it's okay for me.

37:42.553 --> 37:45.281
I just have one
requirement, to stay alive.

37:46.683 --> 37:48.055
Nanxing...

37:49.073 --> 37:51.163
And Kexin fell a few days ago.

37:51.163 --> 37:55.235
I feel so unsafe when I think of it.

37:55.393 --> 37:56.593
Mi.

37:56.593 --> 37:59.283
One of them is in Yunnan,
and the other is in Beijing,

37:59.283 --> 38:01.113
how could they be together?

38:01.113 --> 38:02.203
Cyber love.

38:02.203 --> 38:02.883
That's cyber love.

38:02.883 --> 38:03.843
It's not okay.

38:03.843 --> 38:05.563
They should be together.

38:05.883 --> 38:09.779
The daughter of your aunt
married to the northeast area.

38:09.803 --> 38:13.393
Now they would live in Sanya
for half of the year and Harbin for the other.

38:13.393 --> 38:15.593
They are living a comfortable life.

38:15.593 --> 38:16.873
That's right.

38:17.683 --> 38:19.843
She has retired.

38:19.843 --> 38:21.803
But Dou needs to work.

38:21.953 --> 38:23.953
They will find a solution.

38:23.953 --> 38:25.163
Take the plane.

38:25.163 --> 38:26.473
It's fast.

38:26.473 --> 38:27.034
The plane?

38:27.034 --> 38:28.993
It would be expensive
to take the plane every day.

38:28.993 --> 38:30.073
You don't understand.

38:30.073 --> 38:32.243
Xie is a boss.

38:32.243 --> 38:34.473
How could a boss be poor, right?

38:34.473 --> 38:36.097
You're such a miser.

38:36.323 --> 38:40.659
He is rich, and has much loan to pay.

38:40.683 --> 38:44.473
In my opinion, as long as he
is nice, and you like each other,

38:44.473 --> 38:46.097
we will agree.

38:46.564 --> 38:47.723
That's right.

38:47.723 --> 38:48.393
Mi.

38:48.393 --> 38:50.073
When you found a boyfriend,

38:50.073 --> 38:53.233
your mom and I didn't look down upon him, right?

38:53.473 --> 38:55.553
Why would you look down upon him?

38:55.553 --> 38:57.693
Because he has too many houses?

38:59.553 --> 39:00.593
Look at you.

39:00.593 --> 39:02.683
Don't tell the truth so honestly.

39:02.683 --> 39:05.207
You are such a miser.

39:06.953 --> 39:10.881
You should discuss it with your family first.

39:11.073 --> 39:12.953
You thought about it yourself.

39:12.953 --> 39:15.369
After that, you just told us about it.

39:15.393 --> 39:17.317
We ignored you, so what?

39:19.323 --> 39:22.675
But I need to think clearly myself.

39:23.643 --> 39:27.219
I'm not the one
that just graduated from college.

39:27.243 --> 39:31.363
Choose another way, and
find a place to start again,

39:31.953 --> 39:33.829
it needs courage.

39:35.913 --> 39:37.213
You're right.

39:39.393 --> 39:43.141
I thought, you like your former job.

39:43.723 --> 39:45.347
I liked it.

39:46.513 --> 39:48.437
Maybe my mind changed.

39:51.163 --> 39:56.992
I feel I'm so small, so unimportant.

39:56.993 --> 39:58.413
When I stand there,

39:58.553 --> 40:00.285
people can see me.

40:00.953 --> 40:05.553
But I think no one sees me.

40:07.843 --> 40:12.202
Do you know, when I
saw the clock in the hotel,

40:12.203 --> 40:17.242
I feel I'm like the spring on the pointer.

40:17.243 --> 40:18.723
You have been walking forward.

40:18.723 --> 40:19.883
It has been pushing you.

40:19.883 --> 40:22.323
But you don't know where you are going.

40:22.323 --> 40:24.031
You just move around.

40:29.243 --> 40:32.499
I feel I can't see myself clearly.

40:33.243 --> 40:35.299
It's boring.

40:35.513 --> 40:39.259
Whether I'm standing in that position,

40:39.283 --> 40:41.409
or it is someone else,

40:41.433 --> 40:44.929
it makes no difference to the hotel.

40:48.643 --> 40:49.923
So,

40:52.243 --> 40:55.103
only in front of my best friend,

40:55.683 --> 41:00.432
I feel I'm important in this city,

41:00.433 --> 41:04.853
and I'm treasured by someone else.

41:10.033 --> 41:11.313
Sister,

41:14.473 --> 41:16.157
after Nanxing died,

41:16.993 --> 41:18.273
I...

41:19.073 --> 41:22.053
I felt my heart became empty.

41:25.433 --> 41:26.713
I feel,

41:28.033 --> 41:29.313
it's like,

41:29.393 --> 41:31.533
my feet can't touch the ground.

41:38.593 --> 41:39.977
I don't know

41:41.393 --> 41:42.473
which way to go.

41:42.473 --> 41:43.683
And I don't know where I am.

41:43.683 --> 41:49.231
I want to do nothing every day,
and I'm not interested in anything.

41:51.203 --> 41:53.679
Don't cry.

41:54.073 --> 41:55.805
So I resigned.

41:58.643 --> 42:00.315
Nanxing told me,

42:01.163 --> 42:03.639
she wants me to do the thing I want.

42:04.913 --> 42:06.193
But I...

42:06.433 --> 42:09.209
I don't know what I want to do.

42:10.323 --> 42:12.283
Most people don't know that.

42:14.513 --> 42:16.473
You don't know that, either?

42:21.203 --> 42:23.631
I... I'm not sure.

42:24.803 --> 42:28.731
I'm stressed now.

42:29.113 --> 42:30.393
But,

42:30.513 --> 42:33.673
I think my husband and kid are good,

42:34.323 --> 42:36.243
so I'm happy.

42:36.243 --> 42:37.523
It's good.

42:38.243 --> 42:40.095
That's living at present.

42:40.283 --> 42:41.563
That's good.

42:43.683 --> 42:45.583
I never thought of it.

42:46.843 --> 42:50.779
Whether it's good or
bad, who can define it?

42:50.803 --> 42:53.963
Who can promise the way you choose is good?

42:54.433 --> 42:56.357
So just live the life.

42:57.283 --> 42:58.895
Work,

42:59.203 --> 43:00.483
get married,

43:00.593 --> 43:01.873
have a baby,

43:03.033 --> 43:04.945
buy a house like others,

43:05.033 --> 43:06.813
buy a car like others.

43:07.163 --> 43:08.967
Follow others' pace.

43:09.683 --> 43:12.159
Always be with the majority.

43:12.323 --> 43:15.435
I'll always stay in the safe zone.

43:18.393 --> 43:21.859
Sister, this is the
first time that I feel

43:21.883 --> 43:24.467
you are so bourgeois and detached.

43:27.553 --> 43:31.593
Confusion, or puzzle,
I have no time for that.

43:31.593 --> 43:33.073
That needs energy.

43:33.073 --> 43:35.033
Internal exhaustion, just like you.

43:35.033 --> 43:36.513
Internal exhaustion.

43:37.203 --> 43:37.953
Yes.

43:37.953 --> 43:39.481
That's me.

43:39.593 --> 43:40.873
That's me.

43:43.203 --> 43:44.483
So,

43:45.433 --> 43:47.033
just do what you want.

43:47.393 --> 43:49.049
Don't live in the past,

43:49.073 --> 43:50.757
or rely on the future.

43:51.593 --> 43:55.953
Just don't regret the thing you want to do.

43:56.553 --> 43:57.833
Okay.

43:58.163 --> 43:59.163
I'm sleepy.

43:59.163 --> 44:00.463
I'll go to sleep.

44:00.803 --> 44:01.803
Don't go.

44:01.803 --> 44:03.283
Let's chat.

44:03.283 --> 44:03.804
Continue.

44:03.804 --> 44:05.235
Okay.

44:06.843 --> 44:08.123
Say it,

44:08.953 --> 44:10.233
I'll listen.

44:11.073 --> 44:15.072
Let me tell you my idea on homestay hotels.

44:15.073 --> 44:16.433
You've been there.

44:16.803 --> 44:20.473
City people, especially
people who were born in cities,

44:20.473 --> 44:23.073
they've never been to a place
that is so close to nature.

44:23.073 --> 44:24.473
It's not that original.

44:24.473 --> 44:26.593
The transportation is convenient.

44:26.593 --> 44:31.163
Stressful people like
me, when they go there,

44:31.163 --> 44:34.802
they would like to watch the sky and clouds,

44:34.803 --> 44:37.489
and think about what to eat all day.

44:37.513 --> 44:41.549
I have a feeling of being cured
from inside to outside.

44:42.073 --> 44:47.885
It's like a buffer between life and reality.

44:48.393 --> 44:49.741
A buffer.

44:50.393 --> 44:51.673
And then?

44:52.163 --> 44:53.643
Xie Zhiyao said,

44:54.113 --> 44:56.243
a good entrepreneur
should be a good storyteller.

44:56.243 --> 44:58.163
I think my experience is great.

44:58.163 --> 45:00.015
It's a good story.

45:00.433 --> 45:01.913
I don't know what to say.

45:01.913 --> 45:03.323
He changed you.

45:03.323 --> 45:04.887
It only means,

45:04.953 --> 45:07.585
I have the idea of a boss.

45:08.033 --> 45:12.165
You said so much, it's just for a man.

45:12.883 --> 45:15.647
He is an important part.

45:15.723 --> 45:17.003
But,

45:17.163 --> 45:20.839
I want both the man and my career.

45:21.243 --> 45:22.513
Good.

45:22.513 --> 45:23.763
Well done.

45:23.763 --> 45:25.723
It seems you picked yourself up.

45:25.723 --> 45:26.883
I support you.

45:26.883 --> 45:28.163
Go ahead.

45:28.393 --> 45:32.273
Well, sister,

45:32.803 --> 45:37.179
it's risky to open a homestay hotel.

45:37.203 --> 45:39.033
And I don't have much money.

45:39.033 --> 45:42.489
Mom and dad would think I'll starve again.

45:42.513 --> 45:45.952
Your boyfriend can cook.
You don't need to starve.

45:45.953 --> 45:47.853
He is not my boyfriend yet.

45:52.513 --> 45:57.553
Sister, after I started my
business, if the man I like leaves,

45:57.553 --> 46:00.809
and I fail in the business,
what should I do?

46:01.113 --> 46:02.929
Live in the moment.

46:05.683 --> 46:06.963
Okay.

46:07.283 --> 46:08.703
Live in the moment.

46:11.643 --> 46:13.639
Live in the moment.

46:14.683 --> 46:17.603
You have a weapon that others don't.

46:19.073 --> 46:20.353
Your sister.

46:30.243 --> 46:31.819
Go to sleep.

46:33.953 --> 46:35.829
I can't feel my legs.

46:36.593 --> 46:37.683
Be careful, I can't feel my legs.

46:37.683 --> 46:39.523
Be careful.

46:43.513 --> 46:50.021
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

46:50.953 --> 46:56.837
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

46:58.363 --> 47:04.732
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

47:04.733 --> 47:11.133
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

47:13.073 --> 47:19.485
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

47:20.443 --> 47:26.219
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

47:27.873 --> 47:34.402
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

47:34.403 --> 47:41.775
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

47:42.683 --> 47:49.123
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

47:49.123 --> 47:57.123
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

47:57.253 --> 47:59.303
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

47:59.303 --> 48:03.932
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

48:03.933 --> 48:12.273
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

